{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10002_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:336ababac562bd4e41dda46491265cd4b5bbe341b8e5e830d4e0ea45ab17b045",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_e:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fb66e877517eba4b6816f120ca9962848f9c17a0653373581ebd661e3c3d9e3",
      "text": "呼……●●●●プロデューサー，\n刚才那遍唱得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e1c68378ff3a9390488ddc3857997906ed7386b3e14e5e9fc31af2e37e80615",
      "text": "非常棒！\n大家的配合默契十足。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ea807b22e9cf1ad89c007934aebe31b791aa753f66883b855a90874d3134a4a",
      "text": "谢啦。\n之前花不少时间深入讨论这首歌果然没白费啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95aa4369801dad5250d643139c599ee065bc752a3aa68bb62a4945b23a7b67ca",
      "text": "是一首从清晨就能让人汲取活力、积极向上的歌曲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4ee21ed76fd0504406dac97871fe23cbd19f7c519b8521a721d6fb10bc24ca7",
      "text": "而且曲调很清爽，非常好记呢！\n忍不住就会跟着哼起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ba0c0521b5eae93a407a5f32b2b3a220d741be02fe970ea7f6900811f0fa12b",
      "text": "歌词里也充满了很多积极向上的信息，\n让人元气满满……真想快点让大家听到啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_e:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7412fc3ca28daf3ba91ddc244ee0f1207653597f2ea00ffff8b7033edced5dd9",
      "text": "哈哈，龙。不用着急，距离正式开演还有一周呢。\n在那之前，把各自的课题好好改善改善吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_e:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cadf53c1911cbc05995985be9e525d58b12db046dc83cbbf74697569a609717",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n练习时间稍微延长一点没问题吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_e:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:983ed0ff110540e2cec048620610b2e21e8056700d08f10bac5bf7c532c81d88",
      "text": "没问题的。\n我也陪大家一起！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_e:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc7b3b9baee24c605474c174c58417feacd10a7a46e121289becdcae4d2cc793",
      "text": "好。那就再从头来一遍！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
